@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000

### 1. Get all movies (200, array)
GET {{baseUrl}}/movies

### 2. Get one existing movie (200)
GET {{baseUrl}}/movies/1

### 3. Get a missing movie (404 MOVIE_NOT_FOUND)
GET {{baseUrl}}/movies/999

### 4. Create a valid movie (201, server creates id)
POST {{baseUrl}}/movies
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Arrival",
  "year": 2016,
  "genre": "Sci-Fi"
}

### 5. Create an invalid movie (400 VALIDATION_ERROR)
POST {{baseUrl}}/movies
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "",
  "year": "not a number"
}

### 6. Replace a movie with PUT (200)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/movies/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Inception: Updated Edition",
  "year": 2010,
  "genre": "Sci-Fi"
}

### 7. PUT with a missing property (400)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/movies/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Inception: Updated Edition"
}

### 8. PUT a missing movie (404)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/movies/999
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Ghost",
  "year": 1990,
  "genre": "Drama"
}

### 9. Partially update a movie with PATCH (200, only year changes)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/movies/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "year": 2011
}

### 10. PATCH with an invalid value (400)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/movies/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "year": 1500
}

### 11. PATCH a missing movie (404)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/movies/999
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "year": 2000
}

### 12. Filter by genre (case-insensitive) and year, sorted by year (200)
GET {{baseUrl}}/movies?genre=sci-fi&minYear=2000&sort=year

### 13. Sort by title (200)
GET {{baseUrl}}/movies?sort=title

### 14. Filter with no matches (200, empty array)
GET {{baseUrl}}/movies?genre=Horror

### 15. Invalid minYear (400)
GET {{baseUrl}}/movies?minYear=invalid

### 16. Unsupported sort value (400)
GET {{baseUrl}}/movies?sort=rating

### 17. Delete an existing movie (204, empty body)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/movies/1

### 18. Delete the same movie again (404)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/movies/1

### 19. Unknown route (404 ROUTE_NOT_FOUND)
GET {{baseUrl}}/does-not-exist
